{"info": {"address1": "Auras Corporate Centre", "address2": "5th Floor No:98-A, Dr. Radhakrishnan Road Mylapore", "city": "Chennai", "zip": "600004", "country": "India", "phone": "91 44 2847 8666", "website": "https://www.ramcocements.in", "industry": "Building Materials", "industryKey": "building-materials", "industryDisp": "Building Materials", "sector": "Basic Materials", "sectorKey": "basic-materials", "sectorDisp": "Basic Materials", "longBusinessSummary": "The Ramco Cements Limited manufactures and sells cement and construction Chemicals in India. The company offers blended cements and OPC products; ready mix concrete; and construction chemical products, including waterproofing compound, anchoring grout, micro concrete, bonding agent, plaster and putty, block fix, Tilefix, and Tilegrout. It also provides construction solutions for housing projects, apartments/institutions, public infrastructure projects, and industrial projects; and technical assistance and after-sales support to builders and customers. In addition, the company is involved in the generation and sale of electricity from windmills and thermal power plants; manpower supply; transportation of goods by road; and information technology services. It also sells its products to the Maldives and Myanmar through direct and merchant exports. The company was formerly known as Madras Cements Ltd. and changed its name to The Ramco Cements Limited in July 2013. The Ramco Cements Limited was incorporated in 1957 and is headquartered in Chennai, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Arrakundal Velayutha Raja Dharmakrishnan A.C.A., B.Com.", "age": 68, "title": "Chief Executive Officer", "yearBorn": 1957, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 187900000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. S.  Vaithiyanathan A.C.A., B.Sc.", "age": 60, "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1965, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 24200000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue